game-name-bang = BANG! The Bullet

bang-role-sheriff = Sheriff
bang-role-deputy = Deputy
bang-role-outlaw = Outlaw
bang-role-renegade = Renegade
bang-role-hidden = hidden role

bang-card-label = { $card }, { $playing_card }
bang-card-detail = { $card }. { $description }
bang-card-detail-bang = Shot card: { $card}. { $description }
bang-card-detail-weapon = Weapon to equip: { $card}. { $description }
bang-card-bang = BANG!
bang-card-bang-description = Brown shot card. Fire at one player within your current weapon range. Normally only one BANG! may be played per turn.
bang-card-barrel = Barrel
bang-card-barrel-description = Blue card. When an attack showing a BANG! symbol targets you, each active Barrel may make a draw check; Hearts supplies one Missed! effect.
bang-card-beer = Beer
bang-card-beer-description = Regain one life, including while saving yourself at zero life. At maximum life, or when only two players remain, you may play Beer but it is discarded without effect.
bang-card-bible = Bible
bang-card-bible-description = Green card. Place it in front of you. Starting on a later turn, discard it as one Missed! effect, then draw one card; if the attack still needs a defense, an eligible card just drawn may be used immediately.
bang-card-binocular = Binocular
bang-card-binocular-description = Blue card. You see every other player at a distance reduced by one, to a minimum of one.
bang-card-brawl = Brawl
bang-card-brawl-description = Discard one additional hand card, then make every other player discard one chosen in-play card or one random hand card.
bang-card-buffalo-rifle = Buffalo Rifle
bang-card-buffalo-rifle-description = Green card. Place it without choosing a target. On a later turn, discard it and choose any other player to shoot, regardless of distance.
bang-card-can-can = Can Can
bang-card-can-can-description = Green card. Place it without choosing a target. On a later turn, discard it and choose any other player to lose one chosen in-play card or one random hand card.
bang-card-canteen = Canteen
bang-card-canteen-description = Green card. Place it in front of you. Starting on a later turn, discard it to regain one life.
bang-card-cat-balou = Cat Balou
bang-card-cat-balou-description = Make any other player discard one chosen in-play card or one random hand card, regardless of distance.
bang-card-conestoga = Conestoga
bang-card-conestoga-description = Green card. Place it without choosing a target. On a later turn, discard it and choose any other player to take one chosen in-play card or one random hand card.
bang-card-derringer = Derringer
bang-card-derringer-description = Green card. Place it without choosing a target. On a later turn, discard it and choose a player at distance one to shoot; after the shot resolves, draw one card.
bang-card-dodge = Dodge
bang-card-dodge-description = Play as one Missed! effect against an attack showing a BANG! symbol, then draw one card.
bang-card-duel = Duel
bang-card-duel-description = Challenge any other player. The target answers first; alternate discarding BANG! cards until one player stops and loses one life.
bang-card-dynamite = Dynamite
bang-card-dynamite-description = Blue card. At turn start, Spades 2 through 9 explodes for three life; otherwise Dynamite passes to the next clockwise player who does not already have one.
bang-card-gatling = Gatling
bang-card-gatling-description = Shoot every other player. Each target must provide one Missed! effect or lose one life.
bang-card-general-store = General Store
bang-card-general-store-description = Reveal one card per player currently in play, including an active Ghost Town ghost. Starting with you and proceeding clockwise, each player chooses one.
bang-general-store-reveals = General Store reveals { $count } cards: { $cards}.
bang-you-take-general-store-card = You take { $card } from General Store.
bang-player-takes-general-store-card = { $player } takes { $card } from General Store.
bang-card-hideout = Hideout
bang-card-hideout-description = Blue card. Every other player sees you at a distance increased by one.
bang-card-howitzer = Howitzer
bang-card-howitzer-description = Green card. Place it in front of you. Starting on a later turn, discard it to shoot every other player; each needs one Missed! effect.
bang-card-indians = Indians!
bang-card-indians-description = Every other player must discard one BANG! card or lose one life.
bang-card-iron-plate = Iron Plate
bang-card-iron-plate-description = Green card. Place it in front of you. Starting with the next player's turn, discard it as one Missed! effect.
bang-card-jail = Jail
bang-card-jail-description = Blue card placed on another player; the Sheriff is immune except in a three-player game. At that player's turn start, Hearts removes Jail safely; any other result skips the turn.
bang-card-knife = Knife
bang-card-knife-description = Green card. Place it without choosing a target. On a later turn, discard it and choose a player at distance one to stab; the target needs one Missed! effect.
bang-card-missed = Missed!
bang-card-missed-description = Play as one Missed! effect against an attack showing a BANG! symbol.
bang-card-mustang = Mustang
bang-card-mustang-description = Blue card. Every other player sees you at a distance increased by one.
bang-card-panic = Panic!
bang-card-panic-description = Take one chosen in-play card or one random hand card from a player at distance one.
bang-card-pepperbox = Pepperbox
bang-card-pepperbox-description = Green card. Place it without choosing a target. On a later turn, discard it and choose a player within your current weapon range to shoot.
bang-card-pony-express = Pony Express
bang-card-pony-express-description = Green card. Place it in front of you. Starting on a later turn, discard it to draw three cards.
bang-card-punch = Punch
bang-card-punch-description = Punch one player at distance one; the target needs one Missed! effect or loses one life.
bang-card-rag-time = Rag Time
bang-card-rag-time-description = Discard one additional hand card, then take one in-play card or one random hand card from any other player.
bang-card-remington = Remington
bang-card-remington-description = Blue Weapon. Equip it for range 3.
bang-card-rev-carabine = Rev. Carabine
bang-card-rev-carabine-description = Blue Weapon. Equip it for range 4.
bang-card-saloon = Saloon
bang-card-saloon-description = Every player currently in play regains one life, up to their maximum.
bang-card-schofield = Schofield
bang-card-schofield-description = Blue Weapon. Equip it for range 2.
bang-card-scope = Scope
bang-card-scope-description = Blue card. You see every other player at a distance reduced by one, to a minimum of one.
bang-card-sombrero = Sombrero
bang-card-sombrero-description = Green card. Place it in front of you. Starting with the next player's turn, discard it as one Missed! effect.
bang-card-springfield = Springfield
bang-card-springfield-description = Discard one additional hand card to shoot any other player regardless of distance.
bang-card-stagecoach = Stagecoach
bang-card-stagecoach-description = Draw two cards.
bang-card-ten-gallon-hat = Ten Gallon Hat
bang-card-ten-gallon-hat-description = Green card. Place it in front of you. Starting with the next player's turn, discard it as one Missed! effect.
bang-card-tequila = Tequila
bang-card-tequila-description = Discard one additional hand card to let any player currently in play, including you, regain one life.
bang-card-volcanic = Volcanic
bang-card-volcanic-description = Blue Weapon. Equip it for range 1 and any number of BANG! cards during your turn.
bang-card-wells-fargo = Wells Fargo
bang-card-wells-fargo-description = Draw three cards.
bang-card-whisky = Whisky
bang-card-whisky-description = Discard one additional hand card to regain two life.
bang-card-winchester = Winchester
bang-card-winchester-description = Blue Weapon. Equip it for range 5.

bang-character-bart-cassidy = Bart Cassidy
bang-character-bart-cassidy-ability = After surviving damage, draw one card for every life point lost.
bang-character-black-jack = Black Jack
bang-character-black-jack-ability = Reveal the second phase-one draw; on Hearts or Diamonds, draw one extra card.
bang-character-calamity-janet = Calamity Janet
bang-character-calamity-janet-ability = Use BANG! as Missed! and Missed! as BANG!.
bang-character-el-gringo = El Gringo
bang-character-el-gringo-ability = After surviving player-caused damage, take one random card from that player per life lost.
bang-character-jesse-jones = Jesse Jones
bang-character-jesse-jones-ability = The first phase-one draw may be taken randomly from another player's hand.
bang-character-jourdonnais = Jourdonnais
bang-character-jourdonnais-ability = Always has a virtual Barrel, which stacks with one real Barrel.
bang-character-kit-carlson = Kit Carlson
bang-character-kit-carlson-ability = Look at the top three cards, draw the required number, and return the rest without changing their order.
bang-character-lucky-duke = Lucky Duke
bang-character-lucky-duke-ability = Reveal two cards for every draw check and choose the preferred result.
bang-character-paul-regret = Paul Regret
bang-character-paul-regret-ability = Other players see him at a distance increased by one.
bang-character-pedro-ramirez = Pedro Ramirez
bang-character-pedro-ramirez-ability = The first phase-one draw may come from the top of the discard pile.
bang-character-rose-doolan = Rose Doolan
bang-character-rose-doolan-ability = Sees every other player at a distance decreased by one.
bang-character-sid-ketchum = Sid Ketchum
bang-character-sid-ketchum-ability = Between completed effects, including outside his turn or during his own lethal recovery, discard exactly two hand cards to regain one life.
bang-character-slab-the-killer = Slab the Killer
bang-character-slab-the-killer-ability = His BANG! cards require two Missed! effects.
bang-character-suzy-lafayette = Suzy Lafayette
bang-character-suzy-lafayette-ability = Draw a card whenever her hand becomes empty after the current effect ends.
bang-character-vulture-sam = Vulture Sam
bang-character-vulture-sam-ability = Collect the cards of every eliminated character.
bang-character-willy-the-kid = Willy the Kid
bang-character-willy-the-kid-ability = May play any number of BANG! cards.
bang-character-apache-kid = Apache Kid
bang-character-apache-kid-ability = Cards of Diamonds played by other players do not affect him, except during a Duel.
bang-character-belle-star = Belle Star
bang-character-belle-star-ability = During her turn, cards in front of other players have no effect.
bang-character-bill-noface = Bill Noface
bang-character-bill-noface-ability = Draw one card plus one for each current injury in phase one.
bang-character-chuck-wengam = Chuck Wengam
bang-character-chuck-wengam-ability = During his turn, lose one non-final life to draw two cards.
bang-character-doc-holyday = Doc Holyday
bang-character-doc-holyday-ability = Once per turn, discard two hand cards for a BANG! effect within weapon range.
bang-character-elena-fuente = Elena Fuente
bang-character-elena-fuente-ability = May use any hand card as Missed!.
bang-character-greg-digger = Greg Digger
bang-character-greg-digger-ability = Regain two life whenever another character is eliminated.
bang-character-herb-hunter = Herb Hunter
bang-character-herb-hunter-ability = Draw two cards whenever another character is eliminated.
bang-character-jose-delgado = José Delgado
bang-character-jose-delgado-ability = Up to twice per turn, discard a blue hand card to draw two cards.
bang-character-molly-stark = Molly Stark
bang-character-molly-stark-ability = Outside her turn, draw a replacement after playing or voluntarily discarding BANG!, Missed!, or Beer from hand. Cards already in play do not count.
bang-character-pat-brennan = Pat Brennan
bang-character-pat-brennan-ability = Instead of normal phase-one drawing, take exactly one card from play.
bang-character-pixie-pete = Pixie Pete
bang-character-pixie-pete-ability = Draw three cards in phase one.
bang-character-sean-mallory = Sean Mallory
bang-character-sean-mallory-ability = His end-of-turn hand limit is ten.
bang-character-tequila-joe = Tequila Joe
bang-character-tequila-joe-ability = Every Beer he plays restores two life instead of one.
bang-character-vera-custer = Vera Custer
bang-character-vera-custer-ability = At the start of her turn, copy another living character until her next turn.
bang-character-claus-the-saint = Claus "The Saint"
bang-character-claus-the-saint-ability = Draw one more card than the players currently in play, give one to each other player, and keep two.
bang-character-johnny-kisch = Johnny Kisch
bang-character-johnny-kisch-ability = When he puts a card in play, discard all other in-play cards with that name.
bang-character-uncle-will = Uncle Will
bang-character-uncle-will-ability = Once per turn, use any hand card as General Store.

bang-event-blessing = Blessing
bang-event-blessing-description = Every card's suit is Hearts.
bang-event-curse = Curse
bang-event-curse-description = Every card's suit is Spades.
bang-event-ghost-town = Ghost Town
bang-event-ghost-town-description = Eliminated players return as ghosts for their turns, draw three, cannot be eliminated during the turn, then leave play again. Ghosts may still regain life.
bang-event-gold-rush = Gold Rush
bang-event-gold-rush-description = Ordinary turns run counterclockwise; explicitly clockwise effects do not change.
bang-event-hangover = Hangover
bang-event-hangover-description = Character abilities do not work.
bang-event-high-noon = High Noon
bang-event-high-noon-description = Each player loses one life at the start of their turn.
bang-event-shootout = Shootout
bang-event-shootout-description = A player may play a second BANG! card during their turn.
bang-event-the-daltons = The Daltons
bang-event-the-daltons-description = On reveal, each player with blue cards in play discards one of them.
bang-event-the-doctor = The Doctor
bang-event-the-doctor-description = On reveal, every living player tied for the lowest life regains one.
bang-event-the-reverend = The Reverend
bang-event-the-reverend-description = Beer cards cannot be played.
bang-event-the-sermon = The Sermon
bang-event-the-sermon-description = The active player cannot use BANG! cards, including BANG! responses during a Duel.
bang-event-thirst = Thirst
bang-event-thirst-description = Draw one fewer card in phase one.
bang-event-train-arrival = Train Arrival
bang-event-train-arrival-description = Draw one additional card in phase one.
bang-event-handcuffs = Handcuffs
bang-event-handcuffs-description = After drawing, the active player declares one suit and may play only that suit during the turn; other players' responses are unrestricted.
bang-event-new-identity = New Identity
bang-event-new-identity-description = At turn start, optionally become your public alternate character at two life.
bang-event-fistful-of-cards = A Fistful of Cards
bang-event-fistful-of-cards-description = At turn start, face one avoidable BANG! for each card in your hand.
bang-event-abandoned-mine = Abandoned Mine
bang-event-abandoned-mine-description = During phase one, draw from the discard pile until it is empty, then finish from the draw pile. Put end-turn excess cards face down on the draw pile.
bang-event-ambush = Ambush
bang-event-ambush-description = Base distance between every two players is one; modifiers still apply.
bang-event-blood-brothers = Blood Brothers
bang-event-blood-brothers-description = At turn start, optionally lose one non-final life to heal another player by one.
bang-event-dead-man = Dead Man
bang-event-dead-man-description = The first eliminated player returns once on their next turn with two life and two cards, then draws normally.
bang-event-hard-liquor = Hard Liquor
bang-event-hard-liquor-description = A player may skip phase one to regain one life.
bang-event-lasso = Lasso
bang-event-lasso-description = Cards in play have no effect. They remain in place, and Jail and Dynamite do not perform turn-start checks.
bang-event-law-of-the-west = Law of the West
bang-event-law-of-the-west-description = Reveal the second phase-one card and play it during phase two if possible.
bang-event-peyote = Peyote
bang-event-peyote-description = Instead of drawing, repeatedly guess red or black and reveal each card to everyone; keep correct cards and stop on a miss.
bang-event-ranch = Ranch
bang-event-ranch-description = Once after phase one, discard any number of hand cards and draw the same number.
bang-event-ricochet = Ricochet
bang-event-ricochet-description = Discard BANG! cards to attack cards in play at any distance; one Missed! effect saves each card.
bang-event-russian-roulette = Russian Roulette
bang-event-russian-roulette-description = Starting with the Sheriff, or the Deputy with three players, keep moving clockwise and avoiding shots until the first failure loses two life and stops it.
bang-event-sniper = Sniper
bang-event-sniper-description = Discard two BANG! cards for one reachable shot that requires two Missed!.
bang-event-the-judge = The Judge
bang-event-the-judge-description = No player may put a blue or green card in play.
bang-event-vendetta = Vendetta
bang-event-vendetta-description = At turn end, a Hearts draw check grants one extra turn; the extra turn does not check again.

bang-event-mode-none = Off — standard turns
bang-event-mode-high-noon = High Noon set — 14 events, then turn-start damage
bang-event-mode-fistful = A Fistful of Cards set — 14 events, then shots based on hand size
bang-event-mode-combined = Mixed set — 12 events, then a random finale
bang-option-expanded-cards = Expanded cards and characters: { $enabled }
bang-option-expanded-cards-description = On, by default: 120 cards, all 34 characters, delayed-use green cards, and 3 to 8 players. Off: 80 cards, 19 characters, no green cards, and 4 to 7 players. Events are separate.
bang-option-changed-expanded-cards = Expanded cards and characters are now { $enabled }.
bang-option-event-rules = Turn-changing events: { $mode }
bang-option-event-rules-prompt = Choose whether and how events change the rules each round.
bang-option-event-rules-description = Mixed is the default. Starting with round two, one event changes the rules until the next. A full set has 14 shuffled events and its lasting finale; Mixed has 12 events and a random finale. Off keeps standard turns.
bang-option-changed-event-rules = Turn-changing events are now { $mode }.

